+        // the DFA emits a phantom empty record and the NFA does not.
+        // Pinned by the canonical failing test
+        // `hegel_trailing_comment_line_yields_phantom_record_known_bug`.
+        // Append a literal `\n` so EOF can never happen inside a comment
